"`create_product_shopify` (which creates a brand-new listing; this one "
"only ever updates one that already exists, or deletes it when "
"`to_sell_on_shopify` is \"Non\") -- and deletes the \"Annonces Shopify\" "
"record in that case"
msgstr ""

#: ../../update_product.md ced1bf8ab38a459595f35f09ac6356d3
msgid "**Origin**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../update_product.md a770a644f8b943ad89221090d62e10ba
